Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.252.175.115","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76654,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b36613deb35e576a02fe1139ddf922a6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;This is def one of the hardest decisions, I just cannot make a decision. I&#039;m doing a beach wedding so I wanna keep it light and tropical because we are going to be in Jamaica but then I also want to do elegant on the beach.... There are so many options though! :wacko:&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1843856,"PostDate":1397221881,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>This is def one of the hardest decisions, I just cannot make a decision. I'm doing a beach wedding so I wanna keep it light and tropical because we are going to be in Jamaica but then I also want to do elegant on the beach.... There are so many options though! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wacko.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wacko:' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cheyennenew4@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.252.175.115","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1397196030,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"cheyennenewman","Id":277548,"Name":"cheyennenewman","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.89.250.179","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76654,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"25ee431751da20da6323af3a162d1f3b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@Cheyennenewman&amp;nbsp; LOL! this is exactly what I&#039;m talking about! We are also doing a beach wedding in Jamaica :)&amp;nbsp; I want it to be fun and not too formal but at the same time more than just sundresses. Decisions, decisions!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1843865,"PostDate":1397225913,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@Cheyennenewman\u00a0 LOL! this is exactly what I'm talking about! We are also doing a beach wedding in Jamaica <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0 I want it to be fun and not too formal but at the same time more than just sundresses. Decisions, decisions!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dm@eawifi.com","IpAddress":"198.89.250.179","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1395189111,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"danielleandryan2015","Id":277219,"Name":"danielleandryan2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.82.4.242","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76654,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"568b136592bb72da56c439c9eb1c0e7b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I think if you do yellow and Khaki, the yellow will have to be very bright and not pale or it may look washed out. Personally I love yellow and gray. Those are my colors. I think those colors have the perfect balance of elegance and fun. Yellow of very cheerful and fun and the gray kind of pulls it all together. Just my opinion! And I&#039;m obviously biased because that&#039;s what I picked :-)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1844028,"PostDate":1397318222,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I think if you do yellow and Khaki, the yellow will have to be very bright and not pale or it may look washed out. Personally I love yellow and gray. Those are my colors. I think those colors have the perfect balance of elegance and fun. Yellow of very cheerful and fun and the gray kind of pulls it all together. Just my opinion! And I'm obviously biased because that's what I picked :-)<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Meggan.Kole@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.82.4.242","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1385156577,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275259.jpg?_r=1421618186","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Megg","Id":275259,"Name":"Megg","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.89.250.179","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76654,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1df84c6b5fd235ae65442db4d9a2b69d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Well I went with my bridesmaids today and we looked at lots of options. Ultimately we stuck with the yellow and blue. We decided on blue dresses, its called \"pool\"&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp; yellow \"canary\"&amp;nbsp;accents. They look really good together and I think the blue dresses will look better than yellow to go with the khaki pants. I am very glad I let my girls help decide as they will be the ones wearing them!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1844168,"PostDate":1397435458,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Well I went with my bridesmaids today and we looked at lots of options. Ultimately we stuck with the yellow and blue. We decided on blue dresses, its called \"pool\"\u00a0with\u00a0 yellow \"canary\"\u00a0accents. They look really good together and I think the blue dresses will look better than yellow to go with the khaki pants. I am very glad I let my girls help decide as they will be the ones wearing them!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dm@eawifi.com","IpAddress":"198.89.250.179","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1395189111,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"danielleandryan2015","Id":277219,"Name":"danielleandryan2015","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":14,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
