{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.115.109.154","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78216,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a3827d1ac33473c974ab27ca75ad8bb8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;With regards to the $800 fee - just keep in mind that although it sounds like a lot, it&#039;s not a bad idea to do some research before settling on the Moon Palace vendors. For example, their in house DJ (JSAV\/PSAV) has received quite a few negative reviews on this website and it also super expensive. I&#039;m getting our DJ (Disco Movil, who has stellar reviews on this website) for LESS than the Moon Palace DJ even once I add in the $800 fee...&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1877555,"PostDate":1414959401,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>With regards to the $800 fee - just keep in mind that although it sounds like a lot, it's not a bad idea to do some research before settling on the Moon Palace vendors. For example, their in house DJ (JSAV\/PSAV) has received quite a few negative reviews on this website and it also super expensive. I'm getting our DJ (Disco Movil, who has stellar reviews on this website) for LESS than the Moon Palace DJ even once I add in the $800 fee...<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katymareneck@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.115.109.154","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDa