;\n&lt;p&gt;Bridal U4Ria is located in Florida, established in 2005, specializing in Destination Weddings in Jamaica.&amp;nbsp;With every couples dream wedding in mind, Bridal U4Ria aims to create the reality of that dream. Every aspect of size, venue, attire, transportation,&amp;nbsp;lodging accommodation, photography\/videography,&amp;nbsp;DJ, hair\/makeup\/nails&amp;nbsp;can be handled, and is done uniquely per couple.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915459,"PostDate":1472217313,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi everyone,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Bridal U4Ria is located in Florida, established in 2005, specializing in Destination Weddings in Jamaica.\u00a0With every couples dream wedding in mind, Bridal U4Ria aims to create the reality of that dream. Every aspect of size, venue, attire, transportation,\u00a0lodging accommodation, photography\/videography,\u00a0DJ, hair\/makeup\/nails\u00a0can be handled, and is done uniquely per couple.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vivani86@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"107.197.37.239","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1472146845,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"bridalu4ria","Id":287626,"Name":"bridalu4ria","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.136.106.154","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80275,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cf98e5e5f331d8b14243f1f4b778c8c7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"bridalu4ria\"] welcome to the amazing BDW community. We are photographers based in the Mayan Riviera but we travel throughout the Caribbean photographing wedding. We were recently in Cuba &amp;amp; Jamaica for weddings a few months ago. Send us a message if you have couples looking for great wedding photographers &amp;lt;3&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915460,"PostDate":1472221944,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287626\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/287626-bridalu4ria\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">bridalu4ria<\/span><\/a> welcome to the amazing BDW community. We are photographers based in the Mayan Riviera but we travel throughout the Caribbean photographing wedding. We were recently in Cuba & Jamaica for weddings a few months ago. Send us a message if you have couples looking for great wedding photographers <3<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1915460]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2016\/post-287055-0-76025200-1472236247.jpg\" title=\"Kayla_Aaron_Teaser_10.jpg - Size: 78.48KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bd